{"strongs": "H0758", "word": "אֲרָם", "translit": "a.ram", "root": "ארם", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Aram", "definition": "אֲרָם 149 proper name, masculine Aram (Assyrian Aramu, etc., see Dl Pa 257 ; Thes and others propose √ ארם = רום but compare Nö as below) — 1. 5th son of Shem Gen 10:22 ; Gen 10:23 ; 1Chr 1:17 . 2. grandson of Nahor Gen 22:21 . 3. 1Chr 2:23 . 4. a descendant of Asher 1Chr 7:34 . — Elsewhere only of AramÊan people & land (= 1 above), feminine 2Sam 8:5 masculine 2Sam 10:14 . \\ \\ a. people, singular collective = the Aramoeans , a leading branch of the Shemitic stock inhabiting Mesopotamia & northern Syria, in many tribes & settlements; 2Sam 8:5 (twice in verse); 2Sam 8:6 + 1Kgs 20:20 ; 1Kgs 20:21 + 1Chr 19:10 ; 1Chr 19:12 + (64 t. Samuel Kings Chronicles) Amos 9:7 ; Isa 7:2 ; Isa 7:4 ; Isa 7:5 ; Isa 7:8 ; Isa 9:11 ; Isa 17:3 ; so Ezek 16:57 ; Ezek 27:16 , but Co in both אדום עַם אֲרָם Amos 1:5 of particular divisions of Aram, בית רְחוֺב ׳ א 2Sam 10:6 , צוֺבָא ׳ א 2Sam 10:6 ; 2Sam 10:8 ; Ps 60:2 (title), דַּמֶּשֶׂק ׳ א 2Sam 8:5 compare 1Chr 18:5 , even נַהֲרַיִם ׳ א Ps 60:2 (title); (note that Assyrian never gives name Aramu to people west of Euphrates, but Chatti instead, with other particular names, COT Gen 10:22 , also Dl l.c .); on 2Sam 8:12 ; 2Sam 8:13 ; 1Chr 18:11 see אֱדוֺם . \\ \\ b. less often clearly of land, Aram Num 23:7 ; 2Sam 15:8 + 2Chr 20:2 (read however here אדום Thes Add and others), ׳ שְׂדֵה א Hos 12:13 also of particular divisions of the territory נַהֲרַיִם ׳ א 'Mesopotamia,' i.e. probably land between Euphrates & Chaboras, so Di after Kiep , Gen 24:10 ; Deut 23:5 ; Judg 3:8 (compare Ps 60:2 above); compare ׳ פַּדַּן א Paddan-Aram Gen 25:20 ; Gen 31:18 ; Gen 33:18 ; Gen 35:9 ; Gen 35:26 ; Gen 46:15 , ׳ פַּדֶּ֫נָה א Gen 28:2 ; Gen 28:5 ; Gen 28:6 ; Gen 28:7 see פדן ; דַּמֶּשֶׂק ׳ א 2Sam 8:6 compare 1Chr 18:6 . \\ \\ c. often indeterminate, especially in ׳ מֶלֶךְ א etc., perhaps primarily land but often including people: so Judg 2:11 ; Judg 10:6 ( ׳ אֱלֹהֵי א ) 1Kgs 10:29 + 2Chr 1:17 + (41 t. Kings & Chronicles) Isa 7:1 . — (compare especially Nö Sehenkel BL, ZMG 1871, 113; Hermes see 3, 443 f. Dl Pa 257 .)", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB762')\">BDB762</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H758')\">H758</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H760')\">H760</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H763')\">H763</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB761')\">BDB761</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB763')\">BDB763</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֲרָם</bdbheb><sub>149</sub> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <highlightword>Aram</highlightword> (Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>Aramu,</highlight></transliteration> etc., see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>Pa 257</sup></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> and others propose √ <bdbheb>ארם</bdbheb> = <bdbheb>רום</bdbheb> but compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö</lookup> as below) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> 5th son of Shem <ref ref=\"Gen 10:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,22)\">Gen 10:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 10:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,23)\">Gen 10:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 1:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,1,17)\">1Chr 1:17</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> grandson of Nahor <ref ref=\"Gen 22:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,22,21)\">Gen 22:21</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:23\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,23)\">1Chr 2:23</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> a descendant of Asher <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:34\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,34)\">1Chr 7:34</ref>. — Elsewhere only of AramÊan people &amp; land (= <b>1</b> above), <b>feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"2Sam 8:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,5)\">2Sam 8:5</ref></sup> <b>masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"2Sam 10:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,14)\">2Sam 10:14</ref></sup>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> people, singular collective = <highlight>the Aramoeans</highlight>, a leading branch of the Shemitic stock inhabiting Mesopotamia &amp; northern Syria, in many tribes &amp; settlements; <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,5)\">2Sam 8:5</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,6)\">2Sam 8:6</ref> + <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:20\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,20)\">1Kgs 20:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,21)\">1Kgs 20:21</ref> + <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:10\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,10)\">1Chr 19:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:12\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,12)\">1Chr 19:12</ref> + (64 t. Samuel Kings Chronicles) <ref ref=\"Amos 9:7\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,7)\">Amos 9:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 7:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,2)\">Isa 7:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 7:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,4)\">Isa 7:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 7:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,5)\">Isa 7:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 7:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,8)\">Isa 7:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 9:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,9,11)\">Isa 9:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 17:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,17,3)\">Isa 17:3</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><wrongReferenceRemoved/> so <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:57\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"57\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"57\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,57)\">Ezek 16:57</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,16)\">Ezek 27:16</ref>, but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> in both <bdbheb>אדום</bdbheb> <bdbheb>עַם אֲרָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 1:5\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(30,1,5)\">Amos 1:5</ref> of particular divisions of Aram, <bdbheb>בית רְחוֺב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,6)\">2Sam 10:6</ref>, <bdbheb>צוֺבָא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,6)\">2Sam 10:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,8)\">2Sam 10:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 60:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,2)\">Ps 60:2</ref> (title), <bdbheb>דַּמֶּשֶׂק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,5)\">2Sam 8:5</ref> compare <ref ref=\"1Chr 18:5\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(13,18,5)\">1Chr 18:5</ref>, even <bdbheb>נַהֲרַיִם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 60:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,2)\">Ps 60:2</ref> (title); (note that Assyrian never gives name <highlight>Aramu</highlight> to people west of Euphrates, but <highlight>Chatti</highlight> instead, with other particular names, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('COT')\">COT</lookup> <ref ref=\"Gen 10:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,22)\">Gen 10:22</ref>, also <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>l.c</sup></lookup>.); on <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:12\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,12)\">2Sam 8:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:13\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,13)\">2Sam 8:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 18:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,18,11)\">1Chr 18:11</ref> see  <bdbheb><reflink>אֱדוֺם</reflink></bdbheb>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> less often clearly of land, Aram <ref ref=\"Num 23:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,23,7)\">Num 23:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,8)\">2Sam 15:8</ref> + <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,2)\">2Chr 20:2</ref> (read however here <bdbheb>אדום</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> Add and others), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שְׂדֵה א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 12:13\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(28,12,13)\">Hos 12:13</ref> also of particular divisions of the territory <bdbheb>נַהֲרַיִם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <highlight>'Mesopotamia,'</highlight> i.e. probably land between Euphrates &amp; Chaboras, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> after <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kiep')\">Kiep</lookup>, <ref ref=\"Gen 24:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,10)\">Gen 24:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 23:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,5)\">Deut 23:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 3:8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,8)\">Judg 3:8</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"Ps 60:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,2)\">Ps 60:2</ref> above); compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פַּדַּן א</bdbheb> <highlight>Paddan-Aram</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 25:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,20)\">Gen 25:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 31:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,18)\">Gen 31:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 33:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,18)\">Gen 33:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 35:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,9)\">Gen 35:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 35:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,26)\">Gen 35:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 46:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,46,15)\">Gen 46:15</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פַּדֶּ֫נָה א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 28:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,28,2)\">Gen 28:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 28:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,28,5)\">Gen 28:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 28:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,28,6)\">Gen 28:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 28:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,28,7)\">Gen 28:7</ref> see  <bdbheb><reflink>פדן</reflink></bdbheb>; <bdbheb>דַּמֶּשֶׂק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,6)\">2Sam 8:6</ref> compare <ref ref=\"1Chr 18:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,18,6)\">1Chr 18:6</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> often indeterminate, especially in <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מֶלֶךְ א</bdbheb> etc., perhaps primarily land but often including people: so <ref ref=\"Judg 2:11\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(7,2,11)\">Judg 2:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 10:6\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(7,10,6)\">Judg 10:6</ref> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֱלֹהֵי א</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:29\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,29)\">1Kgs 10:29</ref> + <ref ref=\"2Chr 1:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,1,17)\">2Chr 1:17</ref> + (41 t. Kings &amp; Chronicles) <ref ref=\"Isa 7:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,1)\">Isa 7:1</ref>. — (compare especially <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö<sup>Sehenkel BL, ZMG 1871, 113; Hermes see 3, 443 f.</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>Pa 257</sup></lookup>.) </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 10:22", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 10, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Gen 10:23", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 10, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "1Chr 1:17", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 1, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Gen 22:21", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 22, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "1Chr 2:23", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 2, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "1Chr 7:34", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 7, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "2Sam 8:5", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 8, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "2Sam 10:14", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "2Sam 8:6", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 8, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "1Kgs 20:20", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 20, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "1Kgs 20:21", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 20, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "1Chr 19:10", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 19, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "1Chr 19:12", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 19, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Amos 9:7", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 9, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 7:2", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 7, "verse": 2}, {"raw